[trp_drunken_sailor,"start",[
  (neg|check_quest_active, "qst_elysium"),
  (quest_slot_eq, "qst_elysium", slot_quest_current_state, 0),
],"Hey, hey, I saw it. I saw Elysium.",
"drunken_sailor_talk",[]],

[trp_drunken_sailor,"start",[],
"He, he, Elysium! He hehe hehe hee. Elysium!", "close_window",[]],

[trp_drunken_sailor|plyr,"drunken_sailor_talk",[],
"What? Elysium you say?", "drunken_sailor_talk2",[]],

[trp_drunken_sailor|plyr,"drunken_sailor_talk",[],
"I don't want to waste my time with drunken fouls like you.", "close_window",[]],

[trp_drunken_sailor,"drunken_sailor_talk2",[],
"Really, really. REALLY! I saw it! ^Let me tell you: Long time ago I was a sailor on a cargo ship. We were heading from Athen to Egypt. But we had bad luck."
+" A storm sunk our ship. I lost consciousness during the storm and when I woke up I was lying on a sandy beach on an island. I started to explore the island."
+" It was full of nice smelling flowers. Lots of ripe and large fruits hang on the trees and litter. Then I heard sweet voices sing."
+" Behind bushes I saw a group of men and women dancing, singing and performing music. They were the most beautiful people I have ever seen. They were happy and enjoyed each other."
+" There was neither hatred nor discord, just an aura of love. But they discovered me. I was told that I am not allowed to be on the island and that I am not allowed to watch them."
+" Then everything turned black. As I woke up, I was lying on the beach of Ostia.^^Alas! Since the day I saw this place, I've been trying to reach it again. I want to live on this island too."
+" I tried everything. EVERYTHING!", "drunken_sailor_talk3",[]],

[trp_drunken_sailor|plyr,"drunken_sailor_talk3",[],
"Hm, interesting tale, but you smell like a wine cellar. Why should I believe you? You're just a drunkard.", "drunken_sailor_talk4",[]],

[trp_drunken_sailor,"drunken_sailor_talk4",[],
"I am indeed drunken. Since I saw this place I am drinking all day long. I know I will never reach it again. I just hope alcohol will kill me fast enough."
+" Maybe I am lucky and the gods will forgive me and allow me to live on Elysium too. But I am not the only one who saw the island."
+" There are many other sailors. Just ask the tavern keeper. He knows all the stories well.", "drunken_sailor_talk5",[]],

