[trp_gambara,"start",[ (quest_slot_eq, "qst_langobard_arrive", slot_quest_current_state, 5),],
"Finally, you're awake. We started to fear you would die. It is good to see you alive.",
"gambara_1_talk_1",[]],
[anyone|plyr,"gambara_1_talk_1",[],
"Who are you? Where am I? What happened? All I remember is an old cat, stroking my face, and giving me water to drink.",
"gambara_1_talk_2",[]],

[anyone,"gambara_1_talk_2",[],
"I am Gambara, Queen of the Winnili, though now we are known as the Longobarbae, the Longbeards. These are my sons, Ybor and Agio.",
"gambara_1_talk_3",[]],

[anyone|other(trp_ybor),"gambara_1_talk_3",[],
"After the battle, I wanted to take your armour and weapons, as it is our tradition to loot enemies we defeated. In particular, I was interested in your weapons. They look so different from what I have seen before. When I noticed you were still breathing, I wanted to cut off your head, but luckily for you, my mother appeared and told me to spare your life. I agreed, as you can see. We brought you home and my mother took good care of you.",
"gambara_1_talk_4",[(call_script, "script_set_conversation_troop", "trp_ybor"),]],

[anyone|plyr,"gambara_1_talk_4",[],
"Have my men sent any message to you to negotiate a ransom for me?",
"gambara_1_talk_5",[]],
[anyone|other(trp_agio),"gambara_1_talk_5",[],
"We haven't heard anything from your men. Nobody arrived in our village since the battle ended.",
"gambara_1_talk_10",[
    (call_script, "script_set_conversation_troop", "trp_agio"),
    (quest_get_slot, ":state", "qst_langobard_arrive", slot_quest_importance),
    (val_sub, ":state", 1),
    (quest_set_slot, "qst_langobard_arrive", slot_quest_importance, ":state"),
]],

[anyone|plyr,"gambara_1_talk_4",[],
"I have to thank you. You spared my life. I owe you something.",
"gambara_1_talk_6",
[(quest_get_slot, ":state", "qst_langobard_arrive", slot_quest_importance),
(val_add, ":state", 1),
(quest_set_slot, "qst_langobard_arrive", slot_quest_importance, ":state"),
]],

[anyone|other(trp_ybor),"gambara_1_talk_6",[],
"You could give me your weapons, then your debts would be paid.",
"gambara_1_talk_7",[(call_script, "script_set_conversation_troop", "trp_ybor"),]],

[anyone,"gambara_1_talk_7",[],
"(She hits him on the back of the head.)^^It's only allowed to rob a dead warrior, not a living one.^And you owe us nothing.",
"gambara_1_talk_8",[]],

[anyone|plyr,"gambara_1_talk_8",[],
"I want to thank you again then. Have you heard anything from my men? Did they search for me?",
"gambara_1_talk_9",[]],

[anyone|other(trp_agio),"gambara_1_talk_9",[],
"Nobody arrived at our village since the battle ended.",
"gambara_1_talk_10",[(call_script, "script_set_conversation_troop", "trp_agio"),]],

[anyone|plyr,"gambara_1_talk_10",[],
"Send a messenger to my men so we can negotiate a ransom. I'm confident we can reach a mutually agreeable solution.",
"gambara_1_talk_11",[]],

[anyone|other(trp_ybor),"gambara_1_talk_11",[],
"(He wants to say something but his mother interrupts him.)",
"gambara_1_talk_12",[(call_script, "script_set_conversation_troop", "trp_ybor"),]],

[anyone,"gambara_1_talk_12",[],
"We don't want any ransom. But we invite you to stay here for a week or two to heal your wounds. You were already on your way into the realm of the dead. It took a lot of effort to get you back. That's why you have to stay so I can make sure you will regain your strength.",
"gambara_1_talk_13",[]],

[anyone|plyr,"gambara_1_talk_13",[],
"Aye, that is very kind of you. I accept your invitation.",
"gambara_1_talk_13_y",[]],
[anyone,"gambara_1_talk_13_y",[],
"We will eat now. Take a seat and be a guest in our house.",
"close_window",
[
    (quest_set_slot, "qst_langobard_arrive", slot_quest_current_state, 8),
    (quest_get_slot, ":state", "qst_langobard_arrive", slot_quest_importance),
    (val_add, ":state", 1),
    (quest_set_slot, "qst_langobard_arrive", slot_quest_importance, ":state"),
    (jump_to_menu, "mnu_longbard_stay"),
    (mission_disable_talk),
    (mission_cam_animate_to_screen_color, 0xFF000000, 3000),
    (finish_mission,4),
]],

[anyone|plyr,"gambara_1_talk_13",[],
"I would even pay if I could leave immediately to be honest. I have better things to do.",
"gambara_1_talk_13_no",[]],
[anyone,"gambara_1_talk_13_no",[],
"Farewell then. You can leave whenever you want.",
"close_window",
[
    (quest_set_slot, "qst_langobard_arrive", slot_quest_current_state, 8),
    (jump_to_menu, "mnu_longbard_leave"),
    (mission_disable_talk),
    (mission_cam_animate_to_screen_color, 0xFF000000, 3000),
    (finish_mission,4),
]],

[trp_kingdom_13_lord,"start",[
    (quest_slot_eq, "qst_langobard_arrive", slot_quest_temp_slot, 1),
    (quest_slot_eq, "qst_langobard_arrive", slot_quest_current_state, 1),
],
"Ah, finally, you've arrived. We're currently preparing the attack. The plan is simple: Their camp is at the mouth of the river. We will surround them from all sides and kill them all. My spies reported they also have their families with them. It seems they really want to settle in our lands! Ha, but we will destroy them before that will happen.", "langobard_prebattle_talk_1",[ (quest_set_slot, "qst_langobard_arrive", slot_quest_temp_slot, 2),]],

[trp_kingdom_13_lord|plyr,"langobard_prebattle_talk_1",[],
"You want to kill their families too?",
"langobard_prebattle_talk_2",[]],

[trp_kingdom_13_lord,"langobard_prebattle_talk_2",[],
"It would be rather cruel to kill only their men. What shall the women and children do without men? They would die in the forests anyway. Also, some of my spies claim their women fight too! I can't believe it, though if that's the case we have to kill them on the battlefield anyway.",
"langobard_prebattle_talk_3",[]],

[trp_kingdom_13_lord|plyr,"langobard_prebattle_talk_1",[],
"Aye, I am ready for the fight!",
"langobard_prebattle_talk_3",[]],

[trp_kingdom_13_lord,"langobard_prebattle_talk_3",[],
"However, let's prepare for battle! The men are already awaiting us.",
"close_window",[
  (finish_mission),
  (jump_to_menu, "mnu_langobard_landing"),
]],

