[anyone|plyr, "gardens_talk_task_finish",
[],
"I am still working on it.", "gardens_talk_task_finish_not",[]],

[anyone, "gardens_talk_task_finish_not",
[],
"Then hurry up!", "close_window",[]],

[trp_fortuna, "start",[
  (neg|check_quest_active, "qst_gardens_of_pleasure"),
  (quest_slot_eq, "qst_gardens_of_pleasure", slot_quest_current_state, 5),
],"And {playername}, will you bring me 200,000 denarii, 10 female and 10 male slaves? As reward you would get the helm of Megas Alexandros.", "gardens_talk_task_15",[]],

[trp_fortuna, "start",[
  (check_quest_active, "qst_gardens_of_pleasure"),
  (quest_slot_eq, "qst_gardens_of_pleasure", slot_quest_current_state, 5),
],"Splendid! The peasants are no longer visiting my garden, that's perfect. From now on I can again sleep at night! Now to your reward. I will tell you why I live in this palace.^As you may noticed, my skin is quite pale compared with most other people from this land. It's because I am not from Mesopotamia. I come from a faraway land, which lies North of Scythia. There the people are more animal than human. My childhood was horrible. Luckily, my village was raided by Scythians and I was taken as prisoner. This happened when I was just a young girl. I was brought before the Scythian king and he liked my appearance.",
"gardens_talk_task_1",[]],

[anyone, "gardens_talk_task_1",
[],"Thus the Scythian king made me his slave. I knew exactly what would come next. But I learned from my mother how to make sure a man will not touch me, at least if he believes in ghosts and evil spirits. Thus I made preparations and tricked him. I made sure he believed I was an evil spirit or ghost in the body of a girl. He didn't dare touch me; nobody dared. As long as they feared me, I was safe. When the king began to consult priests about this matter, I thought it was best for me to leave his court. ",
"gardens_talk_task_2",[]],

[anyone, "gardens_talk_task_2",[
  (str_clear, s15),
  (try_begin),
    (eq, "$g_campaign_type", g_campaign_king),
    (faction_slot_eq, "$players_kingdom", slot_faction_culture, "fac_culture_parthian"),# is parthian king
    (str_store_string, s15, "@ your father"),
  (try_end),
],"As I am bold, I just grabbed some useful things together and ran away. I managed to find a merchant whose wife needed a maid. The merchant was from Parthia and just wanted to leave town to return to Mesopotamia."
+" The merchant's son become quite devoted to me, but I made again sure he would fear me. Unfortunately, once we reached Ktesiphon the merchant's son told his parents I would be an evil witch."
+" Before they could harm me, I took all their money and ran away again. I used the money to establish my own shop. However, I wanted more. I wanted to be something of a 'queen' myself."
+" I made a plan: If I would come close enough with the Parthian king, who was{s15} Vonoses by that time, I could use everything I learned from men to make him my lover. Though, I was just a young woman and not even of noble birth.",
"gardens_talk_task_3",[]],

[anyone, "gardens_talk_task_3",
[],"So I began to spread rumors that I was a princess from faraway Northern lands. But a princess needs a large entourage, right? So I recruited beggars, orphans and widows as my servants and made certain they feared me."
+" Soon the rumors of this Northern princess which had traveled to Ktesiphon just to meet the mighty king of kings, reached the palace. The king's official invited me to the palace. I dressed myself in fine, strange looking clothes and visited king Vonoses."
+" I won his heart with ease. He asked me to become one of his courtiers. I agreed, but with an ulterior motive, to get him to abandon his wife and marry me.",
"gardens_talk_task_4",[]],

[anyone, "gardens_talk_task_4",
[],"Unfortunately for me, his wife was smart as well. I made mistakes, and soon she discovered my secret: namely, that I am not a princess, but only a common woman. Though, the king still loved me more than anyone else."
+" As she realized, she would lose him to me, a random incident happened. One of my slaves told her, I am a witch. To make it even worse, Vonoses died only a few months into his reign. His widow summoned priests and finally, with the help of the priests, they banish me from Ktesiphon."
+" As she knows I love palaces, she banished me to this place: the ruins of old Babylon. And now, I am here and dying of boredom.",
"gardens_talk_task_5",[]],

[anyone|plyr, "gardens_talk_task_5",[
  (eq, "$g_campaign_type", g_campaign_king),
  (faction_slot_eq, "$players_kingdom", slot_faction_culture, "fac_culture_parthian"),# is parthian king
],"Interesting. I heard rumors and tales about this incident. However, I am not sure what to think about you. You wanted to oust my mother, which would have meant that I wouldn't have inherited the throne",
"gardens_talk_task_6_1",[]],

[anyone, "gardens_talk_task_6_1",
[],"-- She wraps a strand of hair around her finger and tilts her head. --^^Call me selfish then. I am a girl who knows what she wants.",
"gardens_talk_task_6_2",[]],

[anyone, "gardens_talk_task_6_2",
[],"I would forget the past and look to the future. I have something very useful for you and if you help me you would obtain it. But for this I would need you to do a second task.",
"gardens_talk_task_7",[]],

[anyone|plyr, "gardens_talk_task_5",[
],"That also means, you are not a god. You told me of something very important and useful for me. Your story is interesting nevertheless I thought I would get a real reward, and I don't see how this is useful to me.",
"gardens_talk_task_6",[]],

[anyone, "gardens_talk_task_6",
[],"Oh, this was just your first task. I have a second one.",
"gardens_talk_task_7",[]],

[anyone|plyr, "gardens_talk_task_7",
[],"A second task? You lied to me!",
"gardens_talk_task_8",[]],

[anyone|plyr, "gardens_talk_task_7",
[],"A second task you say, but...",
"gardens_talk_task_8",[]],

[anyone, "gardens_talk_task_8",
[],"No, {playername}! I guarantee you I have something very useful for you, but I can't give it to you for free.",
"gardens_talk_task_9",[]],

[anyone|plyr, "gardens_talk_task_9",[
  (eq, "$g_campaign_type", g_campaign_king),
  (faction_slot_eq, "$players_kingdom", slot_faction_culture, "fac_culture_parthian"),# is parthian king
],"Very well. I will forget what happened in the past. What do you want?",
"gardens_talk_task_10",[]],

[anyone|plyr, "gardens_talk_task_9",
[],"Very well. What do you want?",
"gardens_talk_task_10",[]],

[anyone, "gardens_talk_task_10",
[],"I enjoyed life in the palace very much and, I would very much like to return to such a lifestyle. If you could bring me: 200,000 denarii, 10 Syrian female and 10 Greek male slaves, then I could live in this garden the way I have always wanted.",
"gardens_talk_task_11",[]],

[anyone|plyr, "gardens_talk_task_11",
[],"200,000 denarii? That's a lot, if you want anything then you first must tell me what I would get as reward. It better be something real, unlike than your stories.",
"gardens_talk_task_12",[]],

[anyone, "gardens_talk_task_12",
[],"I will gift you this fancy linothorax and the helm of Megas Alexandros. I found it in the ruins of Babylon.",
"gardens_talk_task_13",[]],

[anyone|plyr, "gardens_talk_task_13",
[],"The helm of Megas Alexandros you say! That's an offer worth consideration.",
"gardens_talk_task_14",[]],

[anyone, "gardens_talk_task_14",
[],"Not only that! You could always visit me! I want to throw extravagant parties in my palace and you, of course, would always be invited.",
"gardens_talk_task_15",[]],

[anyone|plyr, "gardens_talk_task_15",
[],"Aye, I will bring you 200,000 denarii and 10 Greek male and 10 Syrian female slaves!",
"gardens_talk_task_2_do",[]],

[anyone, "gardens_talk_task_2_do",
[],"Splendid! I expect you back soon.",
"close_window",[
  (set_show_messages, 0),
  (quest_set_slot, "qst_gardens_of_pleasure", slot_quest_current_state, 6),
  (setup_quest_text,"qst_gardens_of_pleasure"),
  (str_store_string, s2, "@Bring 200,000 denarii, 10 female Syrian and 10 male Greek slaves to the strange woman living in the hanging gardens."),
  (call_script, "script_start_quest", "qst_gardens_of_pleasure", "trp_fortuna"),
  (str_clear, s1),
  (add_quest_note_from_sreg, "qst_gardens_of_pleasure", 7, s1, 0),
  (set_show_messages, 1),
  (display_message, "str_quest_updated", message_alert),
]],

[anyone|plyr, "gardens_talk_task_15",
[],"I will think about it.",
"gardens_talk_task_2_nodo",[]],

[anyone, "gardens_talk_task_2_nodo",
[],"Well. You can always find me hanging around in the gardens if you change your mind.",
"close_window",[
  (call_script, "script_end_quest", "qst_gardens_of_pleasure"),
  (finish_mission),
]],

[trp_fortuna, "start",
[(quest_slot_eq, "qst_gardens_of_pleasure", slot_quest_current_state, 3),
 ],
  "Will you help me with my problem and tell those peasants not to visit my garden?", "gardens_talk_quest_e_1",[]],
