[trp_gwenhwyfar|plyr,"member_talk",[
(eq, "$gwenny", 7),
], "I want to talk with you, Gwenhwyfar.", "gwenny_evil_talk",[]],

[anyone,"gwenny_evil_talk",[], "Really, how nice from you. We had no time to know each other better. --She smiles at you.-- So what do you want?", "gwenny_evil_talk2",[(display_message, "@What the hell shall I say?"),]],

[anyone|plyr,"gwenny_evil_talk2",[], "How was your life in ... Eih, I mean how was your childhood?", "gwenny_evil_talk3",[]],

[anyone,"gwenny_evil_talk3",[], "My childhood? I think it was like the childhood of every celtish girl. I lived with my family in a small house. There I had to milking the cows and goats. I had to shear the sheep. I had to cook, sew and make all the women stuff.\
I also helped the priests! That was great. I helped him preparing the sacrifices. That's why some villagers called me 'the touched one'. They mean that the gods have touched me! I always thought a lot about gods and other mystic creatures. All in all it was a peaceful life.\
Not like the adventurous life I now live in your warband.", "gwenny_evil_talk2",[]],

[anyone|plyr,"gwenny_evil_talk2",[], "Why are you always smiling?", "gwenny_evil_talk4",[]],
[anyone,"gwenny_evil_talk4",[], "Oh -- She blushes.-- Am I? Well I guess that's because I am so happy. I mean, you have saved my life! That's incredible! And now I am living an adventurous life full of challenges. It was so boring at home, trust me.", "gwenny_evil_talk5",[]],
[anyone|plyr,"gwenny_evil_talk5",[], "And why are you always watching me! You watch me when I eat, when I sleep, and even when I am thinking. Even in my thoughts and dreams you watch me!", "gwenny_evil_talk6",[]],

[anyone,"gwenny_evil_talk6",[], "-- She becomes even redder.--  ^Eih, I don't watch you! Well, yes sometimes I look at you, because you ... you are ... a handsome man. I am sorry, but I am not watching you when you sleep or eat!", "gwenny_evil_talk7",[]],

[anyone|plyr,"gwenny_evil_talk7",[], "Since you are part of my party I have nightmares! Since you are here I saw strange things happening. I saw dead fish, ravens, corpses! I remember your story! Maybe the villagers are right and you are a demon!", "gwenny_evil_talk8",[]],

[anyone,"gwenny_evil_talk8",[], "-- She becomes pale.--  ^No, no I am no demon. There are no demons! No ghosts, no magical shit! I do not know what causes your nightmares! And regarding the strange things you have seen, I am sure you have seen dead fish, ravens and corpses before I joined your warband too. It has nothing to do with me, you must belive me!", "gwenny_evil_talk9",[]],

[anyone|plyr,"gwenny_evil_talk9",[], "No, you are a demon! I will kill you!", "gwenny_kill",[(assign, "$gwenny", -1),]],

[anyone,"gwenny_kill",[], "-- You take a knife and grab her on the neck. She screams and tries to defend. But unsuccessful. You cut through her throat. Blood is on your hand, on your body. It seems a shadow escapes out of here body. \
Maybe her soul? Or the demon who was in her? Anyway, now you feel better. --", "close_window",[(remove_member_from_party, "trp_gwenhwyfar"),]],

[anyone|plyr,"gwenny_evil_talk9",[], "Hm, you are right.", "gwenny_talk_1",[]],

[anyone|plyr,"gwenny_talk_1",[], "I was wrong, you are no demon. There exists no demons. I simply need some rest.", "gwenny_talk_2",[(add_xp_as_reward, 50),]],

[anyone,"gwenny_talk_2",[], "I am so happy to here that. I thought this would be my end. You are truly a man of mind, who won't be guided by his feelings. And I hope you will soon find some sleep again.", "gwenny_talk_3",[]],

[anyone|plyr,"gwenny_talk_3",[], "Thank you. I feel good after this talk and ... Uff and tired, I think I will sleep some hours!",
"close_window",[
  (add_xp_as_reward, 50),
  (assign, "$gwenny", 8),
]],

