[anyone,"otho_intro",[],
  "Yes it is true! Poppaea is the most beautiful woman of Rome, and she was mine. But Nero, this mound of gluttony, wanted her for him. He forced me to divorce from Poppaea."+
  " Later he divorced from his wife Claudia and married Poppaea. Though, some people say it was Poppaea's plan to get closer to Nero via me."+
  " As I am famous for my extravagant feasts, which also Nero liked to attend. But I don't believe this rumors! I am sure it is because Nero is so incredible envious."+
  " Some day I will take revenge for this insult.",
"otho_intro2",[]],

[anyone|plyr,"otho_intro2",[],
"This are bold words, I would be carefully saying such things about a god.", "otho_intro3",[]],

[anyone,"otho_intro3",[],
"Nero, a god? Nero is as much a god as my dick. As a punishment for marrying Poppaea, Nero already sent me as governor to this dirty province. No, I don't fear him.", "otho_intro4",[]],

[anyone|plyr,"otho_intro4",[],
"Then I wish you good luck with your revenge.", "lord_pretalk",[]],

