[anyone ,"fire_talk_2_new",[
],"Indeed there is something which bothers me...",
"fire_talk_3_new",[]],

[anyone|plyr ,"fire_talk_3_new",[
],"You can tell it to me. Sometimes it helps to talk with a good friend about your worries.",
"fire_talk_4_new",[]],

[anyone ,"fire_talk_4_new",[
],"You are right. I will tell it to you.",
"fire_talk_2",[]],

[anyone ,"fire_talk_2",[
],"I am sure you have noticed that everybody is talking about this great fire which destroyed Rome. Some blame the Princeps and others blame the Christians.",
"fire_talk_3",[]],

[anyone|plyr ,"fire_talk_3",[
  (troop_slot_eq, "trp_player", slot_troop_religion, worships_christus),
],"Yes and it grieves me.",
"fire_talk_4",[]],

[anyone|plyr ,"fire_talk_3",[
  (neg|troop_slot_eq, "trp_player", slot_troop_religion, worships_christus),
],"And whats the problem?",
"fire_talk_4",[]],

[anyone|plyr ,"fire_talk_3",[
  (neg|troop_slot_eq, "trp_player", slot_troop_religion, worships_christus),
],"The Christians? Never heard from them.",
"chrisit_exp",[]],

[anyone ,"chrisit_exp",[],
"The Christians are people who belive that a jew who was crucified in Hierosolyma is the son of God and was reborn three days after his death. But how is it possible that you know nothing about them?",
"fire_talk_3",[]],

[anyone ,"fire_talk_4",[
],"Now also the Princeps blame the christians for the outbrake of the fire. So he ordered to burn them all next to the colosseum. But I do not like that. I am sure they are innocent, and I do not want to kill innocents.",
"fire_talk_5",[]],

[anyone|plyr ,"fire_talk_5",[
  (troop_slot_eq, "trp_player", slot_troop_religion, worships_christus),
],"It is a horrible crime. I know.",
"fire_talk_6",[]],

[anyone|plyr ,"fire_talk_5",[
  (neg|troop_slot_eq, "trp_player", slot_troop_religion, worships_christus),
],"Hm. I don't understand the problem? Romans are famous for killing people, see what Caesar in Gaul did.",
"fire_talk_6",[]],

[anyone ,"fire_talk_6",[
],"Ach. Oh {playername}! I swear that I would never tell it to anyone. But I think I can trust you. Here is my secret: I am also a Christ. That's why I hesitate.",
"fire_talk_7",[
  (quest_set_slot, "qst_important_friends", slot_quest_current_state, 2),
]],

[anyone|plyr ,"fire_talk_7",[
  (troop_slot_eq, "trp_player", slot_troop_religion, worships_christus),
],"Fear not. I am a Christ too.",
"fire_talk_8_christ",[]],

[anyone|plyr ,"fire_talk_7",[
  (neg|troop_slot_eq, "trp_player", slot_troop_religion, worships_christus),
],"Interesting. When this comes out you have a real problem my friend.",
"fire_talk_8",[]],

[anyone ,"fire_talk_8",[],
"I am sure that you won't tell it to anyone. We are friends!",
"kaeso_player_knows_3",[]],

[anyone ,"fire_talk_8_christ",[],
"Good to hear I am not the only one. I hope this crime will stop. I hope Nero will change his mind but it doesn't seem so.",
 "kaeso_player_knows_3",[]],


