[anyone, "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms",[], "In the past centuries Rome has conquered most of the known world.\
 Only the Germanic tribes in the North have resisted their attacks. In the famous battle at Teuteburg they slaughtered three legions.\
 But there are also other lands, which are independent of Roman rule.\
 The British clans still resist Roman occuptions, also the Dacian kingdom.\
 And far in the East lies the Parthian Empire. Rome fought many wars with them.\
 Opportunities are endless and so are the rewards, if you are willing to risk your life for them.", "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_2",[]],

