[anyone,"merchant_quest_1_prologue_0",
[
 ],
  "You have the mark of a slave on your leg. I believe you are one of the slaves who escaped from the villa of Marcus Gaius Crachius."
  +" But I can reassure you. I will not inform the guard nor will I torture you. You are the man I was searching for."
  +" There is a dangerous task I need you to do for me. And as a reward I offer you a good payment and the opportunity to be set free."
  +" You would be a freed slave and you wouldn't have to fear capture, torture or death."
  +" ^Now let me explain the situation and what I want you to do. Right now, Rome faces harsh times."
  +" Bandits are sweeping into the town more frequently. I believe some kind of bandit cartel has been established.", "merchant_quest_1_prologue_1",
[]],

[anyone,"merchant_quest_1_prologue_1",
[
 ],
  "They are leaving their camps in the wild and venturing into town, looking for unwary prey. The watch commander tells us it's because of all the fighting on the frontiers,"
  +" fewer men to keep an eye on the streets, but I'm not sure what to make of that. It seems to me that the most logical explanation is that these bandits have"
  +" an ally inside the walls, who helps them enter unnoticed and helps them identify particularly tempting targets... Last week, you see, they took my brother.", "merchant_quest_1_prologue_2",
[]],

[anyone,"merchant_quest_1_prologue_2",
[],
  "I don't know what my brother was thinking. A lad from a prominent house, out alone after dark..."
 +" But he's family, so what can you do? If you don't protect your kin, then people will start thinking that you can't protect your investements"
 +" either, and I can't have that... No doubt the gang will soon send word about a ransom, but I don't care to pay it.", "merchant_quest_1_prologue_3",[]],

[anyone,"merchant_quest_1_prologue_3",
[],
  "So here's my proposition. You are strong and without fear. Otherwise you wouldn't have been involved into this slave revolt."
 +" Gather a small party, track down these bandits to their lair, teach them a lesson they won't forget, and get my brother back safe."
 +" In return, you'll earn a huge amount of silver and your freedom. What do you say?", "merchant_quest_1a",[]],

