##Alexander talk
[trp_alexander, "start",
[],"Those bastards poisoned me! And then they destroyed everything I built up. Bah, they never understood what opportunities we had. We had the chance to make the largest Empire the world has ever seen! "+
  "We had the chance to unite all cultures into a larger and better one.", "alexander_talk",[]],
[trp_alexander|plyr, "alexander_talk",
[],"Why are you here and not in Elysium? Some people worship you like a god!", "alexander_talk2",[]],
[trp_alexander, "alexander_talk2",
[],"Elysium? Elysium? I don't know, I don't care. I want my old life back, I want my Empire back and the opportunities I had. I want Hephaestion back, my dear friend.", "alexander_talk3",[]],
[trp_alexander|plyr, "alexander_talk3",
[],"Shouldn't Hephaestion be here too?", "alexander_talk4",[]],
[trp_alexander, "alexander_talk4",
[],"Yes, but I haven't found him yet. Millions and millions of souls live in this disgusting place. How shall I find him?", "alexander_talk5",[]],
[trp_alexander|plyr, "alexander_talk5",
[],"Well, you  have enough time, haven't you?", "alexander_talk6",[]],
[trp_alexander, "alexander_talk6",
[],"Yes, time is no problem. I reached eternity.", "close_window",[]],

#julius caesar
[trp_caesar, "start",
[
 ],"A fellow Roman! What has you brought you here? How did you died?", "alexander_talk",[]],
[trp_caesar|plyr, "alexander_talk",
[],"I am not dead yet. I am searching for Teiresias as he can tell me my future.", "alexander_talk2",[]],
[trp_caesar, "alexander_talk2",
[],"You have the face of a true leader, someone who is ambitions and ready to sacrifice everything for his goals. You remind me a little of myself.", "alexander_talk3",[]],
[trp_caesar|plyr, "alexander_talk3",
[],"That's a great honour for me! Some people worship you like a god.", "alexander_talk4",[]],
[trp_caesar, "alexander_talk4",
[],"Me? A god? Ha! I see, you understand nothing. I want to warn you: if you strive to power you will get nothing expect a knife in your back from your most trusted friends. "+
  " And after you die you will have a nice place next to me. Didn't you wonder why I'm here and not in Elysium?", "alexander_talk5",[]],
[trp_caesar|plyr, "alexander_talk5",
[],"I am not sure...", "alexander_talk6",[]],
[trp_caesar, "alexander_talk6",
[],"If you search for salvation, do not strive for power, as you will not find it there.", "close_window",[]],
 ##Achilles talk
[trp_achilleus, "start",
[],
  "You look small and weak. What do you want?", "ach_talk",
[]],
[trp_achilleus|plyr, "ach_talk",
[],"And who are you?", "ach_talk2",[]],
[trp_achilleus|plyr, "ach_talk",
[],"I will leave now.", "close_window",[]],
[trp_achilleus, "ach_talk2",
[],"Everybody know me. My fame runs before me! I am Achilleus. I have fought in the great war against Troy! I became immortal.", "ach_talk3",[]],
[trp_achilleus|plyr, "ach_talk3",
[],"If you are immortal, why are you here?", "ach_talk4",[]],
[trp_achilleus, "ach_talk4",
[],"A joker! Only my name is immortal, not my body. But here, in the realm of shadow, I rule over thousands of souls!", "ach_talk5",[]],
[trp_achilleus|plyr, "ach_talk5",
[],"Interesting, but what can these souls do, and where do you live?", "ach_talk6",[]],
[trp_achilleus, "ach_talk6",
[],"Arg, you are annoying. Souls can do nothing, but they need nothing! You need no house and no lands as an eternal soul. You understand?", "ach_talk7",[]],
[trp_achilleus|plyr, "ach_talk7",
[],"I think I got it!", "ach_talk33",[]],
[trp_achilleus, "ach_talk33",
[],"Good.", "ach_talk",[]],
##Achilles talk END

