[anyone,"antonia_talk6_16",[],
"Firstly, I thought about the following: Great heroes usually go East! Alexander or Achilles for instance. The largest Empires had their origins in the East."
+" And after all I have seen, I am now sure the reason is that the West is just a terrible, cold and rainy place, while in the East you have large cities, trading centers and all that."
+" We will set up our power base in the East! It would also fit perfectly with those myths about a king being born in the East, which I already told you about.^Secondly, the East has another great thing:"
+" Wealthy rebellious provinces! I am speaking of Judea. It's a labyrinth of rivaling rebellious groups, all kinds of sects preaching the end of all days. They are like a sleeping lion."
+" We just need to poke them and then the lion of Judah will awake. They are many and their rebellion will be sizeable.",
"antonia_talk6_17",[
  (quest_set_slot,"qst_blank_quest_19", slot_quest_object_state, 4),
]],

[anyone,"antonia_talk6_17",
[],
  "We will do the following: Piggy-Caesar needs money, and the temple of Hierosolyma is one of the wealthiest temples under Roman rule."
  +" You will convince piggy-Caesar that it is a good idea to force the Jews to share some of their gold with him. We need to ensure that you are the one who oversees the whole mission!"
  +" Then you will travel to Hierosolyma and demand the gold from the Jews. They will go wild and for sure start a rebellion."
  +" You just need to ensure that you can get all the gold away before the enraged Jews kill you. That is the most dangerous part of the mission."
  +" After that, go back to piggy-Caesar and claim that the gold was lost during the revolt.",
  "antonia_talk6_18",
[]],

[anyone|plyr,"antonia_talk6_18",
[],
  "That is a brilliant idea. That way we weaken the Empire and on the same time obtain gold for our war chest.",
  "antonia_talk6_18_1",
[
    (call_script, "script_change_player_relation_with_troop", "$g_talk_troop", 5),
  ]],
[anyone|plyr,"antonia_talk6_18",
[],
  "That is a terrible idea! Way too risky. If the rebels catch me, I am dead!",
  "antonia_talk6_18_2",
[
    (call_script, "script_change_player_relation_with_troop", "$g_talk_troop", -2),
  ]],

[anyone,"antonia_talk6_18_1",
[],
  "Yes, I know that I am a genius.",
  "antonia_talk6_19",
[]],

[anyone,"antonia_talk6_18_2",
[],
  "Don't be a coward. ^^--She slaps you. --^^You are a Roman! Don't forget that!",
  "antonia_talk6_19",
[]],

[anyone,"antonia_talk6_19",
[],
  "Now let me continue. I want to give you some general overview of the political situation and the circle around piggy-Caesar."
  +" The Praetorians have currently pretty much two prefects: Tigellinius and Kaeso Flavius. Tigellinius is cruel and ruthless."
  +" He usually does the dirty job, killing political enemies and so on. He is also a good friend of piggy. While Kaeso is weaker."
  +" He is more reluctant when it comes to killing people. He is also not considered as a close friend of piggy."
  +" But nobody questions his loyalty, as he is kind and content with his position. We need allies in the Praetorian guard, and we will ally with Kaeso."
  +" But more details on this later.",
  "antonia_talk6_20",
[]],

[anyone,"antonia_talk6_20",
[],
  "Among piggy's courtiers are some important figures, worthy of note. First, there is Locusta, who is famous for making all kinds of 'tasty' drinks, which are of course poison."
  +" She has no political ambitions. We could in theory ask her for help, but I am not sure if she is trustworthy."
  +" And who needs poison if he has this^^--She points at your weapon. --^^And this. ^^--She strokes your muscles. --^^Better to have a man with a sword than a woman with poison."
  +" Now there are others: There is Sporus, who is basically a male copy of Poppaea, though much dumber, and with literally no ambitions. He is most likely just a toy of piggy."
  +" Finally, we have Crispinilla. She is basically just a drunkard and average party slut. Don't tell her any secret as all of Rome will know about it in the next day."
  +" She has no political ambitions. She is only in the palace, telling piggy what piggy wants to hear.",
  "antonia_talk6_21",
[]],

[anyone,"antonia_talk6_21",
[],
  "And lastly, we have Poppaea! She has ambitions, large ambitions. She is daughter of Titus Ollis from Picenum and Poppaea Sabina Major."
  +" Her father was a friend of the Praetorian Praefect Seianus, who was probably the most influential Roman during Tiberius rule."
  +" When Seianus had been overthrown, Ollis political carrier came to an end. And that is the reason why Poppaea took the name of her mother, Sabina, instead of Ollia."
  +" I guess she always had great plans and wanted to be part of the circle of power. Or maybe she just wanted enough money for her boundless extravagance."
  +" I don't know what her reasons were in the end, but she started a successful political career by first marrying the Praetorian praefect Rufrius Crispinus."
  +" Then, due to Agrippina ruling over Rome, Crispinus was removed from the position of Praetorian praefect and Poppaea immediately divorced.",
  "antonia_talk6_22",
[]],

[anyone,"antonia_talk6_22",
[],
  "There are plausible rumors that Poppaea already prepared for the time after Crispinus. Even as she was married, she still had an affair with Otho."
  +" Otho was a close friend of piggy by that time. It's kind of obvious what her plan was. At the end she used Otho to get closer to piggy."
  +" And as piggy likes fat blond women like her, she succeeded. The friendship between piggy and Otho broke and Otho was punished by becoming governor of Lusitania, which is literally the arse-end of the world."
  +" You must be very careful with her. Once our plot grows, she for sure will notice it and make her preparations. When she tells you that she loves you, you can be sure it's a lie."
  +" And do not yield her seduction and do not sleep with her! I couldn't forgive you if you would do this!",
  "antonia_talk6_23",
[]],

[anyone|plyr,"antonia_talk6_23",
[],
  "Don't think all of us men are weak! I can fuck a woman without feeling anything, just to pleasure my dick.",
  "antonia_talk6_23_1",
[
    (call_script, "script_change_player_relation_with_troop", "$g_talk_troop", -10),
  ]],
[anyone|plyr,"antonia_talk6_23",
[],
  "I promise that I will not do this.",
  "antonia_talk6_23_2",
[
    (call_script, "script_change_player_relation_with_troop", "$g_talk_troop", 2),
  ]],

[anyone,"antonia_talk6_23_1",
[],
  "--She slaps you. --^^You will not fuck her you bastard. You must stay reasonable.",
  "antonia_talk6_24",
[]],
[anyone,"antonia_talk6_23_2",
[],
  "Very good. You must stay reasonable.",
  "antonia_talk6_24",
[]],

[anyone,"antonia_talk6_24",[
],"I already talked enough, and I think we are running out of time. You do what I said: Convince Nero to confiscate the temple treasury and go to Hierosolyma and raid the temple!"
+" After the lion has awoken, I will met you, mostly likely near Hierosolyma and inform you about the next step."
+" ^^One final thing, before I forget it: Poppaea is most likely worshiping this Jewish god. At least rumors say it."
+" You may use this fact during your conversation with Nero, be careful!",
"close_window",[
  (mission_disable_talk),
  (mission_cam_animate_to_screen_color, 0xFF000000, 2500),
  (finish_mission, 3),

  (quest_set_slot, "qst_freelancing", slot_quest_freelancer_event, 1),
  (assign, "$auto_menu", "mnu_tarquinii_meeting_final"),
  (jump_to_menu, "mnu_auto_return_map"),
]],

